food_prompt:
JSON format: {"dishes":[{"name":string,"ingredients":[{"name":string,"amount_g":number}]}]}

Examples:
Fried rice → {"dishes":[{"name":"fried rice","ingredients":[{"name":"rice","amount_g":200},{"name":"chicken","amount_g":120},{"name":"egg","amount_g":50},{"name":"soy sauce","amount_g":20}]}]}
Ramen → {"dishes":[{"name":"ramen","ingredients":[{"name":"noodles","amount_g":200},{"name":"broth","amount_g":300},{"name":"pork","amount_g":120},{"name":"egg","amount_g":50}]}]}
Salad → {"dishes":[{"name":"greek salad","ingredients":[{"name":"lettuce","amount_g":60},{"name":"feta","amount_g":50},{"name":"tomatoes","amount_g":40},{"name":"olive oil","amount_g":15}]}]}

